    "The longest active run we found in your Apple Health history. Today doesn't break it. Stay above the threshold and the count climbs tomorrow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der längste aktive Streak in deinem Apple Health Verlauf. Der heutige Tag unterbricht ihn nicht. Bleib über dem Schwellenwert, dann steigt der Zähler morgen weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The longest active run we found in your Apple Health history. Today doesn't break it. Stay above the threshold and the count climbs tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La racha activa más larga que encontramos en tu historial de Apple Health. Hoy no la rompe. Mantente por encima del umbral y el contador sube mañana."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De langste actieve reeks die we in je Apple Health-geschiedenis vonden. Vandaag breekt de reeks nog niet. Blijf boven de drempel en morgen loopt de teller verder op."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Самая длинная активная серия в твоей истории Apple Health. Сегодня она не прервётся. Выполняй цель, и завтра счёт вырастет."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chuỗi đang duy trì dài nhất chúng tôi tìm thấy trong lịch sử Apple Health của bạn. Hôm nay chưa làm đứt chuỗi. Tiếp tục đạt ngưỡng để chuỗi dài thêm vào ngày mai."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是我们在你的 Apple Health 历史记录中找到的最长一条进行中的连续记录。今天不会让它中断。达到门槛，明天就会继续累计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This re-analyzes your last %lld days of activity and may suggest a different goal than your current %@. If the new goal is higher than your recent activity, your streak may break.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dabei wird deine Aktivität der letzten %#@n@ neu analysiert. Es kann ein anderes Ziel als dein aktuelles (%2$@) vorgeschlagen werden. Liegt das neue Ziel über deiner letzten Aktivität, kann dein Streak enden."
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg Tages"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg Tage"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This re-analyzes your last %#@n@ of activity and may suggest a different goal than your current %2$@. If the new goal is higher than your recent activity, your streak may break."
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
